{"games":[{"id":432739716,"name":"Wolf Ridge | Bike Park","desc":"","path":"/game/432739716-wolf-ridge-bike-park","slug":"432739716-wolf-ridge-bike-park","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/43550e4762695bc4f2925785de356b939ddc5318faf1cd31ccf3a0562d8f54a4.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f59644fc1f811da66991c1cee919e859/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":204990346,"name":"Tiny Tanks!","desc":"Take control of a tiny tank and blast your way through several maps and game modes in this chaotic multiplayer shooter.  Invite your friends, unlock new tanks, and upgrade your rigs to suit your needs.\n\nThanks for supporting the game!","path":"/game/204990346-tiny-tanks","slug":"204990346-tiny-tanks","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d04826ebdf5dc2d63bbb3341e48ec5da59d550e51f252c989ebf5044c35fb78d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4d8df5bd6e638cfedbc75f473d85d2e5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":70131075,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-10-10T20:29:36.468Z","creator":{"name":"Sharksie","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":270499015,"name":"[CHRISTMAS] Sandhurst Military Academy Roleplay","desc":"Welcome to the original British Military Academy!\n\n❤️ Please drop a like 👍 and favorite ⭐ our game!\n🏗️ Don't forget to follow for more updates on our game!\n\n💂‍♂️ JOIN THE BRITISH ARMY TO BECOME PART OF THE BEST!\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/2621202/BritishArmy\n\n𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧:\nThe British Army Sandhurst Military Academy is where we train our soldiers to fit our motto \"Be The Best.\" This military base has graduated many of the best in combat, investigations, espionage, special operations, piloting, and so much more! \nJoin the British Army group linked above to get FREE access into the base! \n\nDeveloped by Shark Industries Dev Team\n\nTags\nRoleplaying Military Fan Building British Army BA Game Studios Roleplay Biggest Largest Military British Armed Forces Fan Britain United Kingdom ","path":"/game/270499015-sandhurst-military-academy-roleplay","slug":"270499015-sandhurst-military-academy-roleplay","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e3069f25e3f1b9965e0395d723739daf834c26aa5e3d7010bf9e67bacc77d3b0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-57574a1fd875cfcba39ab4e11608cd16/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":50689282,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-29T03:02:33.462Z","creator":{"name":"|BA| British Army","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":24040136,"name":"Innovation Labs","desc":"Enjoy the labs? Check out the Roblox Innovation Labs toy pack now available!  Welcome to Innovation Labs, explore our giant underground facility and gaze upon the cutting edge of science research on ROBLOX, from physics to genetics, from lasers to waffles, there is always interesting and dangerous research to be done. Remember to Thumbs Up! Join Innovation: https://www.roblox.com/groups/group.aspx?gid=157764 \r\nUpdate (13/06/2019) - Converted to shadowmap, small fixes, changed meltdown music to comply with IP rule changes.","path":"/game/24040136-innovation-labs","slug":"24040136-innovation-labs","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6071d9d35686bcf343b5bf68d9d6d30f89e3477c492bebdf91481e58d282432f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e3387a24f1c3db50621fecb150420cd7/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":34531296,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T14:45:52.848Z","creator":{"name":"madattak","type":"User"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":428375933,"name":"The Legend of The Bone Sword RPG","desc":"Embark on a perilous journey to reclaim your homeland from the Bone Lord's evil grasp. Progress through unique worlds and challenges as you grow stronger and collect strange weapons.\n\nBut things are not as they seem. Chaos lingers above, waiting to possess you at your darkest hour. How could you let this happen?\n\nThis game is a work in progress, please report any issues.\nThe old version is still available to play, just follow the floating platforms in The Old Sanctuary.\nThe classic version - https://www.roblox.com/games/6536023653/","path":"/game/428375933-the-legend-of-the-bone-sword-rpg","slug":"428375933-the-legend-of-the-bone-sword-rpg","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ccb4f139a83acd6e524f4c5ef1a9234adb3bb6060788c9958c27241fd9dd3c3d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8f8e833ce6d88ab83c43d1ba66636022/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":20487556,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-08T00:15:57.437Z","creator":{"name":"Starplex","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":402122991,"name":"Redwood Prison","desc":"Welcome to Redwood Correctional Facility.\r\n\r\nI put out an update that should stop everything from going green!\r\n\r\nNew in servers Version 1.428:\r\n- Added Four-Wheelers!\r\n- Prisoners now become hostile when entering helipad area\r\n- added option to remove hats with button or equals key\r\n- can't deal damage to helicopters driven by your own team\r\n- added ammo crates to refill ammo\r\n- new taser effects\r\n- you can now arrest people lying down\r\n- Added some more anti exploit stuff\r\n\r\nGive the game a thumbs up! It lets me know you guys want updates ;D","path":"/game/402122991-redwood-prison","slug":"402122991-redwood-prison","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/231e421d9859577ede6a75194c7801b22fcd5e28b1f1ea695f0c0db2cc42a7be.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f25b43b26d8e0ecf18e41f10cfc6f267/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":296066781,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T05:53:23.889Z","creator":{"name":"RoyStanford","type":"User"},"scrip