lex rooms in this award-winning puzzle-adventure game! And as always - no Hints, no Pausing, and your time starts... NOW! \r\n\r\n🏆 \"Best Single Player Game of the Year\" ~ Bloxy Awards 2018! \r\n🏆 \"Hardest Game\" ~ Bloxy Awards 2017! \r\n🥈 Nominated for Best Map ~ Bloxy Awards 2018! \r\n🥈 Nominated for Best Multiplayer Co-Op Game\"~ Bloxy Awards 2017! \r\n\r\nEscape Room 2 is on its way!!! Make sure to join the group \"Team Escape Room\" for the latest updates, news, and more!\r\n\r\nSpecial Thanks to our official developers, Lavacomet, Revelted, Drezzlez, and Clv2 for their help with these maps, and thank you all so much for your support!","path":"/game/707652019-escape-room","slug":"707652019-escape-room","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3145723af4fee730751270baa8f6e7d37e447636dc9467ff60d7a202aa5a6d50.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4614b46e9477dc996582f803636c9d75/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":102949844,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-08T05:09:34.035Z","creator":{"name":"DevUItra","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":715646038,"name":"Egg Hunt 2017: The Lost Eggs","desc":"","path":"/game/715646038-egg-hunt-2017-the-lost-eggs","slug":"715646038-egg-hunt-2017-the-lost-eggs","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0a5a0a727f259665eb250f33b78935f98a18790ad11d9e1407a56ae66bc3bc42.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-fac40cb8bd958dc1102ed4f720258675/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":885450884,"name":"The Grand Crossing [Border RP]","desc":"","path":"/game/885450884-the-grand-crossing","slug":"885450884-the-grand-crossing","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c26eb3a25d2383268e58b275399145b59af7262097b08a1451c4fe1136d17e0f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-12fb13af1a